sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HCW as Health Care Worker
    participant Tablet as Edge Tablet (Offline)
    participant QR as Patient QR Code
    participant LocalDB as Encrypted SQLite / FHIR Store

    HCW->>QR: Scan digital/printed QR code
    QR->>Tablet: Pass time-signed identity payload
    Tablet->>Tablet: Load cached Public Key (Fayda PKI)
    Tablet->>Tablet: Verify Cryptographic Signature (0 bytes net)
    alt Signature Valid
        Tablet->>LocalDB: Map UIN & Demographics to HL7 FHIR Patient
        LocalDB-->>Tablet: Confirm Local Patient Record Created
        Tablet-->>HCW: Display "Identity Verified & Ready for Care"
    else Signature Invalid
        Tablet-->>HCW: Display "Verification Failed: Tampered Token"
    end
